@host = https://localhost:7194

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. Login do Admin (deve dar 200)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 2. Quem sou eu, com o token (deve dar 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Quem sou eu, sem token (deve dar 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 4. Senha errada (deve dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "senha-errada-qualquer"
}

### 5. E-mail inexistente (deve dar 401, com a MESMA mensagem do item 4)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ninguem@nogvita.local",
  "password": "senha-errada-qualquer"
}

### 6. Sem senha no corpo (deve dar 400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}"
}

### 7. Renovar com o refresh token do login (deve dar 200, com um par NOVO)
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. REUSO: renovar de novo com o token do LOGIN, que já foi usado (deve dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 9. Depois do reuso, até o token NOVO (do item 7) foi revogado (deve dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 10. Logout (deve dar 204). Antes, rode o item 1 de novo, para ter uma sessão nova.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. Renovar depois do logout (deve dar 401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 12. E-mail inválido (deve dar 400, com o erro no campo Email)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria-sem-arroba",
  "password": "qualquer-senha"
}

### 13. Refresh token vazio (deve dar 400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

### 14. Cadastro de paciente (deve dar 201, com os tokens)
# @name registerPatient
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Souza",
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo",
  "birthDate": "1995-03-10",
  "biologicalSex": "Male",
  "heightInCm": 178,
  "goal": "MuscleGain"
}

### 15. O mesmo cadastro de novo (deve dar 409, com a mensagem genérica)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Souza",
  "email": "outro@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo",
  "birthDate": "1995-03-10",
  "biologicalSex": "Male",
  "heightInCm": 178,
  "goal": "MuscleGain"
}

### 16. Dados inválidos (deve dar 400, com vários erros de uma vez)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "sem-arroba",
  "cpf": "111.111.111-11",
  "password": "curta",
  "birthDate": "2090-01-01",
  "biologicalSex": "Male",
  "heightInCm": 0,
  "goal": "MuscleGain"
}

### 17. Meu perfil, com o token do cadastro (deve dar 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{registerPatient.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 18. Atualizar meu perfil (deve dar 200, com os valores novos)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{registerPatient.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1995-03-10",
  "biologicalSex": "Male",
  "heightInCm": 180,
  "goal": "Maintenance"
}

### 19. Perfil de paciente com o token do ADMIN (deve dar 403)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 20. Perfil de paciente sem token (deve dar 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me

### 21. Admin: listar usuários (deve dar 200, paginado)
# @name listUsers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 22. Admin: buscar por nome ou e-mail (deve trazer só o João)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?search=JOAO
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 23. Admin: só os ativos, de 1 em 1 (veja o totalPages)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?isActive=true&pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 24. Admin: pageSize acima do máximo (deve dar 400)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 25. Admin: detalhe do primeiro usuário da lista (deve dar 200, com CPF formatado)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{listUsers.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 26. Admin: Id que não existe (deve dar 404)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 27. Paciente tentando a área do Admin (deve dar 403)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{registerPatient.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 28. João faz login (deve dar 200)
# @name joaoLogin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo"
}

### 29. Admin encontra o João (pega o Id dele)
# @name listPatients
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/patients?search=joao
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 30. Admin DESATIVA o João (deve dar 204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{listPatients.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 31. João tenta RENOVAR a sessão (deve dar 401: as sessões foram revogadas)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{joaoLogin.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 32. João tenta fazer LOGIN de novo (deve dar 401: a conta está inativa)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo"
}

### 33. João usa o token de ACESSO antigo (atenção ao resultado!)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{joaoLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 34. Admin descobre o próprio Id
# @name adminMe
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 35. Admin tenta desativar a SI MESMO (deve dar 409)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{adminMe.response.body.$.userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 36. Admin REATIVA o João (deve dar 204)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{listPatients.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 37. João volta a conseguir fazer login (deve dar 200)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo"
}

### 38. Admin pré-cadastra a Ana, que é NOVA (deve dar 201, com invitationEmailSent = true)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/nutritionists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Lima",
  "email": "ana@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "111.444.777-35",
  "crnRegion": 3,
  "crnNumber": "12345"
}

### 39. Ana aceita o convite definindo a senha (deve dar 204)
# Cole aqui o token do e-mail no Mailpit (o texto depois de "#token=")
@inviteTokenAna = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/invitations/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{inviteTokenAna}}",
  "password": "cha-de-hortela-com-limao"
}

### 40. O MESMO convite de novo (deve dar 400: já foi usado, RN09)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/invitations/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{inviteTokenAna}}",
  "password": "cha-de-hortela-com-limao"
}

### 41. Ana faz login (deve dar 200)
# @name anaLogin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@nogvita.local",
  "password": "cha-de-hortela-com-limao"
}

### 42. Quem é a Ana? (deve mostrar o papel Nutritionist)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anaLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 43. Admin pré-cadastra o JOÃO, que já é paciente (deve dar 201)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/nutritionists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Souza",
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09",
  "crnRegion": 2,
  "crnNumber": "777"
}

### 44. João aceita SEM mandar senha (deve dar 204: ele já tem senha)
@inviteTokenJoao = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/invitations/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{inviteTokenJoao}}"
}

### 45. João entra com a senha DE SEMPRE e agora tem dois papéis
# @name joaoLogin2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@nogvita.local",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo"
}

### 46. Quem é o João? (deve mostrar Patient E Nutritionist)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{joaoLogin2.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 47. CPF do João com OUTRO e-mail (deve dar 409: dados não conferem)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/nutritionists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alguém",
  "email": "outro@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09",
  "crnRegion": 4,
  "crnNumber": "888"
}

### 48. Paciente/nutricionista tentando pré-cadastrar (deve dar 403: só o Admin, RN07)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/nutritionists
Authorization: Bearer {{joaoLogin2.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste",
  "email": "teste@nogvita.local",
  "cpf": "111.444.777-35",
  "crnRegion": 1,
  "crnNumber": "1"
}

### ===== Fase 11B: confirmação de e-mail =====

### 1. Cadastro de paciente → 202
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register/patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paciente Teste",
  "email": "paciente.teste@email.com",
  "cpf": "54585783334",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo",
  "birthDate": "1995-03-10",
  "biologicalSex": "Male",
  "heightInCm": 178,
  "goal": "MuscleGain"
}

### 2. Login ANTES de confirmar, senha certa → 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "paciente.teste@email.com",
  "password": "cafe-com-pao-de-queijo"
}

### 3. Login ANTES de confirmar, senha errada → 401 (não revela a conta pendente)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "paciente.teste@email.com",
  "password": "senha-errada-123"
}

### 4. Confirmar e-mail → 204 (a primeira vez) / 400 (a segunda vez)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/email-confirmation/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "3z8X0djFYtldx14-QivP6fYd7fpahTjQFeH276GtN5m8x1nAiLK3IOddLkWj0DawR33_bFpoI1n8NEH0Inu7Bg"
}

### 5. Reenviar confirmação → sempre 202
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/email-confirmation/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "paciente.teste@email.com"
}

  ### ===== Fase 12: Nutricionista =====

### Lista de nutricionistas (qualquer usuário logado)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### Lista com busca e filtro de região
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists?search=nutri&crnRegion=1
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### Busca com % (não pode devolver todo mundo)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists?search=%25
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### Meu perfil (nutricionista)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### Atualizar minha apresentação (nutricionista)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Nutrição esportiva e reeducação alimentar."
}
### ===================== Fase 13: Acompanhamento =====================
### Rode NA ORDEM, de cima para baixo. Cada bloco usa a resposta dos anteriores.

### 0.1 Login do paciente
# @name loginPaciente
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{pacienteEmail}}",
  "password": "{{pacienteSenha}}"
}

### 0.2 Login da Nutri 1
# @name loginNutri1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{nutri1Email}}",
  "password": "{{nutri1Senha}}"
}

### 0.3 Login da Nutri 2
# @name loginNutri2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{nutri2Email}}",
  "password": "{{nutri2Senha}}"
}

@tokenPaciente = {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@tokenNutri1 = {{loginNutri1.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@tokenNutri2 = {{loginNutri2.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 0.4 Id da Nutri 1
# @name meNutri1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### 0.5 Id da Nutri 2
# @name meNutri2
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}

@nutri1Id = {{meNutri1.response.body.$.userId}}
@nutri2Id = {{meNutri2.response.body.$.userId}}

### A. Paciente lista os nutricionistas → 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### B. Paciente pede acompanhamento à Nutri 1 → 201
# @name pedidoNutri1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri1Id}}",
  "message": "Quero ganhar massa muscular."
}

@pedidoNutri1Id = {{pedidoNutri1.response.body.$.id}}

### C. Paciente repete o pedido → 409 (já tem pendente)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri1Id}}",
  "message": "Segunda tentativa."
}

### D. Nutri 2 tenta aceitar o pedido da Nutri 1 → 404 (RN12)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoNutri1Id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}

### E. Nutri 1 vê a caixa de entrada → o pedido aparece com o nome do paciente
# @name caixaNutri1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

@pacienteId = {{caixaNutri1.response.body.$.items[0].patientId}}

### F. Nutri 1 aceita → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoNutri1Id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### G. Nutri 1 aceita de novo → 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoNutri1Id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### H. Paciente vê o acompanhamento atual → 200 com a Nutri 1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/care-relationship
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### I. Paciente pede à Nutri 2 → 409 (já está em acompanhamento)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri2Id}}"
}

### J. Nutri 1 lista os pacientes → o paciente aparece
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### K. Nutri 2 lista os pacientes → vazia (RN13)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}

### L. Paciente encerra → 204 (e-mail para a Nutri 1 no Mailpit)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/care-relationship/end
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### M.1 Paciente pede à Nutri 2 → 201
# @name pedidoCancelar
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri2Id}}"
}

### M.2 Paciente cancela → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests/{{pedidoCancelar.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### N.1 Paciente pede à Nutri 2 de novo → 201
# @name pedidoRecusar
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri2Id}}"
}

### N.2 Nutri 2 recusa → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoRecusar.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}

### N.3 Histórico do paciente → Accepted, Cancelled e Rejected
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### O.1 Paciente pede à Nutri 1 → 201
# @name pedidoEncerrarPelaNutri
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri1Id}}"
}

### O.2 Nutri 1 aceita → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoEncerrarPelaNutri.response.body.$.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### O.3 Nutri 1 encerra → 204 (e-mail para o PACIENTE no Mailpit)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/patients/{{pacienteId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### ===================== Fase 14: Open Food Facts =====================

### A. Produto que existe (Nutella, o exemplo da documentação) → 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/3017624010701
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### B. Um produto da SUA cozinha → troque pelo código de barras da embalagem
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/7890000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### C. Código inválido → 400 (e não gasta a cota do Open Food Facts)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/abc123
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### D. Código válido que não existe → 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/0000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### E. Paciente → 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/3017624010701
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### ===================== Fase 15: Alimentos =====================

@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### A. Busca sem acento → acha os feijões
# @name buscaFeijao
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=feijao
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### B. Busca com acento e maiúsculas → o mesmo resultado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=FEIJÃO
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### C. Busca com 1 letra → 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=a
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### D. Busca com % → lista vazia (o escape funciona)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=%25%25
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### E. Detalhe do primeiro feijão
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/{{buscaFeijao.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### F. Prévia de um produto da SUA cozinha → alreadyImported: false
@codigoProduto = 7890000000000
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/{{codigoProduto}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### G. Importar → 201
# @name importacao
POST {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/{{codigoProduto}}/import
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### H. Prévia de novo → alreadyImported: true, com o foodId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/{{codigoProduto}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### I. Importar de novo → 200 (não duplica)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/{{codigoProduto}}/import
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### J. Admin desativa o produto → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/foods/{{importacao.response.body.$.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### K. Nutricionista vê o detalhe → 404 (RN19)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/{{importacao.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### L. Admin vê o detalhe → 200, com isActive: false
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/{{importacao.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### M. Admin reativa → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/foods/{{importacao.response.body.$.id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### N. Nutricionista tenta desativar → 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/foods/{{importacao.response.body.$.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### ===================== Fase 16: Plano alimentar =====================
### Rode os logins da Fase 13 antes (loginPaciente, loginNutri1, loginNutri2, meNutri1).

### 0.1 Paciente pede acompanhamento à Nutri 1
# @name pedidoPlano
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri1Id}}"
}

### 0.2 Nutri 1 aceita, e anota o Id do paciente
# @name caixaPlano
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoPlano.response.body.$.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

@pacientePlanoId = {{caixaPlano.response.body.$.items[0].patientId}}

### A. Nutri 1 cria o plano 1 → 201
# @name plano1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{pacientePlanoId}}",
  "name": "Reeducação alimentar",
  "description": "Primeiro plano.",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15",
  "endDate": null
}

### B. Paciente lista os planos → vazia (o rascunho não aparece)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### C. Nutri 1 ativa o plano 1 → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano1.response.body.$.id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### D. Paciente vê o plano atual → o plano 1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### E.1 Nutri 1 cria o plano 2 → 201
# @name plano2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{pacientePlanoId}}",
  "name": "Hipertrofia",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### E.2 Nutri 1 ativa o plano 2 → 204 (e o plano 1 é finalizado)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano2.response.body.$.id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### F. Paciente lista → plano 2 (Active) no topo, plano 1 (Finished) embaixo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### G. Nutri 1 tenta editar o plano 1 (finalizado) → 409
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano1.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tentando mudar",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15"
}

### H. Nutri 1 tenta cancelar o plano 2 (ativo) → 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano2.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### I. Nutri 2 tenta ver o plano 2 → 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano2.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}

### J. Nutri 1 cria um rascunho (plano 3) → 201
# @name plano3
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{pacientePlanoId}}",
  "name": "Rascunho",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### K.1 Paciente encerra o acompanhamento → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/care-relationship/end
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### K.2 Paciente lista → plano 2 e plano 1, os dois Finished
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### K.3 Paciente vê o plano atual → 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### L. Nutri 1 tenta ver o plano 2 → 404 (perdeu o acesso)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{plano2.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### M. Nutri 1 tenta criar um plano para o paciente → 404 (sem vínculo)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{pacientePlanoId}}",
  "name": "Sem vínculo",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### ===================== Fase 16B: Recuperação de senha =====================

### A. Pedir a recuperação → 202 (e chega o e-mail no Mailpit)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{pacienteEmail}}"
}

### B. Pedir para um e-mail que não existe → 202 (e NENHUM e-mail chega)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ninguem.existe@email.com"
}

### C. Guardar um refresh token ANTES da troca (para provar que ele morre)
# @name loginAntesDaTroca
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{pacienteEmail}}",
  "password": "{{pacienteSenha}}"
}

### D. Senha nova fraca → 400, com o erro no campo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "newPassword": "123"
}

### E. Confirmar com a senha nova → 204 (e chega o aviso "senha alterada")
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "newPassword": "{{pacienteSenhaNova}}"
}

### F. O mesmo link de novo → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "newPassword": "{{pacienteSenhaNova}}"
}

### G. Login com a senha ANTIGA → 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{pacienteEmail}}",
  "password": "{{pacienteSenha}}"
}

### H. Login com a senha NOVA → 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{pacienteEmail}}",
  "password": "{{pacienteSenhaNova}}"
}

### I. Refresh com o token de ANTES da troca → 401 (a sessão antiga morreu)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAntesDaTroca.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### ===================== Fase 17: Refeições =====================
### Rode os logins da Fase 13 antes (loginPaciente, loginNutri1, loginNutri2, meNutri1).

### 0.1 Paciente pede acompanhamento à Nutri 1
# @name pedidoRefeicoes
POST {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutritionist-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nutritionistId": "{{nutri1Id}}"
}

### 0.2 Nutri 1 vê a caixa de entrada
# @name caixaRefeicoes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### 0.3 Nutri 1 aceita
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/requests/{{pedidoRefeicoes.response.body.$.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### 0.4 Nutri 1 cria o plano
# @name planoRefeicoes
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{caixaRefeicoes.response.body.$.items[0].patientId}}",
  "name": "Plano com refeições",
  "startDate": "2026-10-20"
}

@planoId = {{planoRefeicoes.response.body.$.id}}

### A.1 Adicionar o café da manhã → 201
# @name cafe
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Café da manhã",
  "notes": "Beber um copo de água antes."
}

### A.2 Adicionar o almoço → 201
# @name almoco
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Almoço"
}

### A.3 Adicionar o jantar → 201
# @name jantar
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jantar"
}

### B. Detalhe do plano → as 3 refeições, na ordem 1, 2, 3
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### C. Reordenar: jantar, café, almoço → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals/order
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mealIds": [
    "{{jantar.response.body.$.id}}",
    "{{cafe.response.body.$.id}}",
    "{{almoco.response.body.$.id}}"
  ]
}

### D. Reordenar com uma refeição faltando → 400
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals/order
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mealIds": [
    "{{jantar.response.body.$.id}}"
  ]
}

### E. Renomear o almoço → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals/{{almoco.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Almoço pós-treino",
  "notes": "Até 1 hora depois do treino."
}

### F. Remover o café (que está no meio) → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals/{{cafe.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### G. Detalhe → jantar (1) e almoço pós-treino (2), sem buraco
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### H. Nutri 2 tenta adicionar uma refeição → 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Intrusa"
}

### I. Ativar o plano → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### J. Paciente vê o plano atual → com as 2 refeições, na ordem
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### K. Finalizar o plano → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### L. Adicionar uma refeição no plano finalizado → 409 (RN17)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ceia"
}

### M. Remover uma refeição do plano finalizado → 409 (RN17)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoId}}/meals/{{jantar.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### ===================== Fase 18: Alimentos da refeição =====================
### Rode os logins da Fase 13 e o login do admin (Fase 15) antes.
### Rode também o G.1 da Fase 17B (planoHorarios) se ele não estiver na sessão.

### 0.1 Detalhe do plano → para pegar os Ids das refeições
# @name detalheHorarios
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoHorarios.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

@planoAlimentosId = {{planoHorarios.response.body.$.id}}
@cafeId = {{detalheHorarios.response.body.$.meals[0].id}}
@preTreinoId = {{detalheHorarios.response.body.$.meals[1].id}}

### 0.2 Buscar o arroz
# @name buscaArroz
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=arroz%20tipo%201%20cozido
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### 0.3 Buscar o feijão
# @name buscaFeijaoPlano
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods?search=feijao%20carioca%20cozido
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

@arrozId = {{buscaArroz.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
@feijaoId = {{buscaFeijaoPlano.response.body.$.items[0].id}}

### A. Arroz no café, 150 g → 201
# @name itemArroz
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 150
}

### B. Arroz no café de novo → 409 (D141)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 50
}

### C. Feijão no café, 80 g → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{feijaoId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 80
}

### D. Quantidade 0 → 400 (RN18)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{preTreinoId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 0
}

### E. Quantidade acima de 2000 g → 400 (D142)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{preTreinoId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 2500
}

### F. Mudar o arroz para 120 g → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods/{{itemArroz.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityInGrams": 120
}

### G. Detalhe → o café com o arroz (120 g) e o feijão (80 g), com o snapshot e a atribuição
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### H. Admin desativa o FEIJÃO → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/foods/{{feijaoId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### I. Detalhe de novo → o feijão CONTINUA no café, com os mesmos valores (o snapshot, item 24)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### J. Feijão no pré-treino → 404 (RN19: inativo)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{preTreinoId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{feijaoId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 80
}

### K. Admin reativa o feijão (para não atrapalhar os próximos roteiros) → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/foods/{{feijaoId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### L. Nutri 2 tenta adicionar no plano da Nutri 1 → 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 100
}

### M. Remover o arroz → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{cafeId}}/foods/{{itemArroz.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### N.1 Ativar o plano → 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### N.2 Paciente vê o plano atual → o café com o feijão (80 g)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}

### ===================== Fase 19: Cálculo nutricional =====================
### Rode os logins da Fase 13, e os blocos 0.1 a 0.3 da Fase 18 (o plano, as refeições, o arroz e o feijão).

### A. Definir a meta → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/target
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "energyKcal": 2000,
  "proteinGrams": 150,
  "carbohydrateGrams": 250,
  "fatGrams": 70
}

### B. Arroz no pré-treino, 67 g → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/meals/{{preTreinoId}}/foods
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodId": "{{arrozId}}",
  "quantityInGrams": 67
}

### C. O detalhe com as porções, os totais e a meta
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### D. Meta com 0 kcal → 400
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/target
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "energyKcal": 0
}

### E.1 Remover a meta → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/target
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### E.2 Detalhe → "target": null, e os totais continuam lá
GET {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}

### F.1 Definir a meta de novo, só com as calorias → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/nutritionists/me/nutrition-plans/{{planoAlimentosId}}/target
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenNutri1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "energyKcal": 1800
}

### F.2 Paciente vê o plano atual → com os totais e a comparação (só das calorias)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patients/me/nutrition-plans/current
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPaciente}}
